1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,042
Every element animates in and out on its
own.

2
00:00:04,042 --> 00:00:08,214
Select the main menu and find its
Animations section.

3
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,255
Pick how it appears.

4
00:00:14,255 --> 00:00:18,905
Each choice tells you in one line what it
looks like.

5
00:00:18,905 --> 00:00:23,643
I'll take Scale: it grows in gently while
it fades in.

6
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:31,996
And how it leaves.

7
00:00:31,996 --> 00:00:32,411
Fade.

8
00:00:32,411 --> 00:00:36,067
The choice is saved straight into the
scene.

9
00:00:36,067 --> 00:00:38,643
There's nothing else to set up.

10
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:48,671
You can watch all ten presets moving on
the Animations page of the docs.

11
00:00:48,671 --> 00:00:54,500
And from code, you can still pick a
different one for a single call.

12
00:00:55,500 --> 00:01:00,214
Next, we'll see how the tools keep every
scene in shape.
